  - m_Id: 6278461214720
    m_Localized: 'Active: Select a Unit; the target is put to sleep for 1 round by
      that Unit (skipping its next turn).


      Passive: Every time Fasila uses
      a skill, one of her Fragments resonates. If she has 3 resonating Fragments,
      her next skill doubles its effect (doubles stats, turns, etc.).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6322916642816
    m_Localized: 'Reduces the target unit''s MDef by X% for 2 rounds.


      X%
      = 10% (HP / 50)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 6371717369856
    m_Localized: Freezes enemy units in the center and right positions for 2 rounds
      (skips the unit's next 2 turns).
